#. packages
#: i18n/en.yaml:138
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "Paket"

#. packages-desc
#: i18n/en.yaml:140
msgid ""
"Some Linux/UNIX OS vendors have kindly provided binary packages of KDE "
"Applications for some versions of their distribution, and in other cases "
"community volunteers have done so. Additional binary packages, as well as "
"updates to the packages now available, may become available over the coming "
"weeks."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa vendor OS Linux/UNIX telah dengan baik hati menyediakan paket biner "
"Aplikasi KDE untuk beberapa versi distribusinya, dan dalam kasus lain, "
"sukarelawan komunitas telah melakukannya. Paket biner tambahan, serta "
"pembaruan untuk paket yang sekarang tersedia, mungkin tersedia selama "
"beberapa minggu mendatang."

